    "detailed_description": "Blockle is multiplayer physics-based tower dismantling game. Each turn, you must carefully remove a block without causing the whole tower to come crashing down. The last player to successfully remove a block without the tower falling is the winner!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Physics-based gameplay<br></li><li>Throw blocks around, get drunk, and flip off your friends<br></li><li>Online and local multiplayer, up to 6 players<br></li><li>Controller support (may require official or third party drivers)</li></ul><br>Online multiplayer population may be low. Bring your own friends!",
